  "notes": "The God Wars Dungeon-variant rare drop table (landmine #3, docs/HANDOFF.md): a genuinely different table from data/tables/rare_drop_table.json (rune sword replaces runite bar, no ring-of-wealth effect, some quantities differ), reached via {{GWDRDT}} at a fixed 8/127 access rate on Kree'arra, General Graardor, Commander Zilyana and K'ril Tsutsaroth. Coins is deliberately NOT a row here: the page's own prose states this table's empty rolls are replaced by a coin drop on the boss's own main table instead — that is the composite Coins raritynotes each of the four boss pages carries (\"Coins come from rolls on all loot tables, including the unique table, GDT and RDT\"), a separate defect this record does not fix. Built from Template:GWDRDT and Template:CalculateRDTNaked directly (see docs/DECISIONS.md), cross-checked against every figure in the rendered dropsline bucket for one of the four sources (Kree'arra) — all 24 items match exactly."
